{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53616","headline":"游天衣寺 · 陆亘","name":"游天衣寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"处世空旦夕，探幽放情志。\n长歌向闲云，引客游古寺。\n秦山倚寥廓，高鸟下苍翠。\n凝阴向杉松，界法齐天地。\n疏钟远僧舍，深殿有猨戏。\n警梵千谿中，真禅寂无二。\n寒泉耸毛发，清露遣心累。\n省虑因悟非，劳神岂爲贵。\n起然静中见，觉了愚胜智。\n愿得栖烟霞，书之谢名利。\n（见《会稽掇英总集》卷八）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆亘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53616.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53616","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}